---
description: On-page SEO rules for tool and guide pages
globs: src/pages/**/*.astro,src/data/tools/**/*.ts
---
- One H1, unique title <60 chars, meta <155, self canonical.
- Primary keyword in title/H1; no duplicate intents (see docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md).
- Breadcrumbs + JSON-LD on every indexable page.
